# Project Context

This project is a banking platform built using a microfrontend architecture.

The stack includes React, TypeScript, Vite, React Router, Tailwind CSS, shadcn/ui, and Module Federation.

## UI

When implementing or modifying UI, use `apps/auth/src/pages/auth/Signup.tsx` as the primary visual reference.

Match its:
- layout
- spacing
- typography
- styling
- shadcn/ui component usage
- overall visual language

Reuse existing components and patterns whenever possible.

## Rules

- Keep changes focused on the requested task.
- Do not modify unrelated files.
- Do not add comments to code.